{"id":"2aa3cbc444df6275","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-validity.md","title":"Validity","display":"df-validity — Validity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-validity","aliases":["93-df-validity"],"display":"df-validity — Validity","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]","[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","[[93-df-first-order-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-validity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-validity — Validity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1f813209c75e1\" href=\"?note=56c1f813209c75e1\" title=\"93-df-first-order-satisfaction\">93-df-first-order-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"84c35fea1e867240\" href=\"?note=84c35fea1e867240\" title=\"93-df-first-order-formula\">93-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ce709e0d2857990\" href=\"?note=0ce709e0d2857990\" title=\"93-df-first-order-structure\">93-df-first-order-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> is a first-order formula candidate, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> is a class of first-order structures.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}\\)</span> have their sourced signatures.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here with an explicit language parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Formula well-formedness and the common first-order language are explicit; empty model classes remain vacuously validating, as usual.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"56c1f813209c75e1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"84c35fea1e867240","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ce709e0d2857990","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi)","display":true}],"bytes":1143,"backlinks":[{"id":"0838691d607f25ab","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}$ is the typed validity predicate of [[93-df-validity]]."},{"id":"2401933431e79141","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}$ is the validity predicate of [[93-df-validity]], and $\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}$ is defined here."}],"outgoing":["56c1f813209c75e1","84c35fea1e867240","0ce709e0d2857990"]}